    "content": "<p>Explore the new season of War Robots: Frontiers and get rewards just for logging in and playing several games!&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Play five battles each day across seven out of 15 days from May 22 to June 6&nbsp;(09:00 UTC)&nbsp;to earn rewards:&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li><strong>Day 1: 3-Day Premium</strong></li>\r\n\t<li><strong>Day 2: 1,000 Credits + Scavenger (Paint)</strong></li>\r\n\t<li><strong>Day 3: 5,000 Salvage</strong></li>\r\n\t<li><strong>Day 4:&nbsp;1,000 Credits</strong></li>\r\n\t<li><strong>Day 5: 5,000 Salvage</strong></li>\r\n\t<li><strong>Day 6: x1,000 Credits + x2 Scrubber (weapon)</strong></li>\r\n\t<li><strong>Day 7:&nbsp;5,000 Credits + 70 Intel</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"important-text important-text--icon important-text--color_special\">\r\n<div class=\"important-text__inner\">\r\n<div class=\"important-text__icon\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"important-text__text\">\r\n<p><strong>IMPORTANT</strong>: You must have completed your Training Battles to participate in the Battle Bonus Event.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<p><strong>Download War Robots: Frontiers for free today:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/playstation\"><strong>PlayStation&reg;5</strong></a><strong>│</strong><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/playstation\"><strong>PlayStation&reg;4</strong></a><strong>│ </strong><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/xbox\"><strong>Xbox Series X|S&trade;</strong></a><strong> │</strong><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/xbox\"><strong>Xbox One&trade;</strong></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/steam\"><strong>Steam</strong></a><strong> │ </strong><a href=\"https://my.games/play/war_robots_frontiers_mg\"><strong>MY.GAMES Launcher</strong></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Stay tuned to our official <a href=\"https://x.com/WRFrontiers\">X</a>, <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/wrfrontiers\">Facebook</a>, <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/wrfrontiers/\">Instagram</a>, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC7xxqQkPAQ7x6wIVEPZus5w\">YouTube</a>, and <a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@wrfrontiers\">TikTok</a> channels, and join the <a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/warrobotsfrontiers/\">War Robots: Frontiers subreddit</a> and <a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/discord\">Discord</a> for all the latest news and updates.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"http://warrobotsfrontiers.com/subscribe\"><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/Newsletter%20Buttons/Updated/EN.png\" /></strong></a></p>",
